  "reviewBody": "Partial reproduction. The gt package could not be installed in the Amsterdam UMC myDRE environment (Error: Chrome debugging port not open after 10 seconds), so the gtsave() lines were commented out and the tables saved manually. Only the first rows of each table could be viewed and these were reproducible; reproducibility of the complete tables could not be verified. Two minor modifications to the original code were needed: installing missing packages and loading stringr.\n",
